<title>USA: Florida DMS, won by Prudential Sec.</title>
<headline>Florida DMS, won by Prudential Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Sec. said it won $13.260 million of Florida Dept. of Management Services, florida facilities pool revenue bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.479 percent.</p>
</text>
